# Docs (Diátaxis)

- Open with **Scope** and **When to use** (2–3 sentences).
- Pick one type per file: tutorial (learning path), how-to (checklist to a goal), reference (tables/facts), explanation (why).
- Prefer checklists and tables; link with relative paths; keep files short.
- Update `docs/index.md` when adding a new doc.
- Do not mix long narrative explanation into how-to checklists.
